{
  "scope": "Model-mediated inspection of actual encoded media; not human listening or owner/SME approval.",
  "initial_review_runs": [
    37401264688,
    37403043909
  ],
  "action": "Clarify the mode name Read in English/Filipino section1 and the English facts-versus-unknowns phrasing; regenerate only those three Read tracks, preserving first audio and all initial/full/focused responses. Add Nena pronunciation directions only to the two affected English sections. Both story inputs and public videos remain exact cached bytes.",
  "conflicting_observations": "Full reviews generally describe consistent timbre; focused excerpts frequently infer multiple speakers or a different perceived gender at sentence boundaries. These are model perceptions, not established speaker identity. A specific opening excerpt is added for the Filipino application check to investigate its initial-voice claim.",
  "semantic_disposition": "The two resident questions are venue and personal health suitability. The three unconfirmed facts are not three resident questions; the original model numerical-inconsistency claim was a mistaken reading of that distinction. Revised English wording makes the distinction explicit.",
  "original_selected_tracks": {
    "module": "05-bhw-at-barangay",
    "sections": {
      "community-listening": {
        "en": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/community-listening.en.14432502d1fa.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "14432502d1fa56b0b054df4e2b32bd2506cb18b2ef1e7f1176797ffdc7b231ff",
          "sha256": "48b83816bf28ffe0bc68d881af3e7e5a515871474683978a739f064540ac9eb8",
          "duration_seconds": 46.994,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Listen before assuming",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 2320
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Malou repeats what she heard: \u201cYou want to confirm the venue and speak with a health professional.",
              "start_ms": 2620,
              "end_ms": 8740
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Have I understood correctly?\u201d",
              "start_ms": 9040,
              "end_ms": 11120
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "Nena can correct that summary and explain what matters to her.",
              "start_ms": 11420,
              "end_ms": 15580
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "Known: Nena has two questions.",
              "start_ms": 15880,
              "end_ms": 18680
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "Unknown: the confirmed venue, the locally designated professional contact, and Nena's preferred way to ask.",
              "start_ms": 18980,
              "end_ms": 26100
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Malou does not assume that Nena needs transport or has a particular illness.",
              "start_ms": 26400,
              "end_ms": 32320
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "She asks, \u201cWhat information would help you, and how would you prefer to receive it?\u201d",
              "start_ms": 32620,
              "end_ms": 37900
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 7,
              "text": "Use fictional details only during practice.",
              "start_ms": 38200,
              "end_ms": 41960
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Repeat, clarify and invite the resident to correct your understanding.",
              "start_ms": 42260,
              "end_ms": 46940
            }
          ]
        },
        "fil": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/community-listening.fil.cb01c2554014.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "cb01c25540148604f10c724f9d6956d777e5af1431a7cde653d2e3bebc35997d",
          "sha256": "31623ba536262837b5be6a16755924f7ad87c5678d3ee0843f5f4015604cc62e",
          "duration_seconds": 55.876,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Makinig bago magpalagay",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 2880
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Inulit ni Malou ang narinig: \u201cGusto ninyong tiyakin ang lugar at makausap ang health professional.",
              "start_ms": 3180,
              "end_ms": 9180
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Tama po ba ang pagkaunawa ko?\u201d",
              "start_ms": 9480,
              "end_ms": 11840
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "Maaaring itama ni Nena ang buod at sabihin kung ano ang mahalaga sa kaniya.",
              "start_ms": 12140,
              "end_ms": 17340
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "Alam: may dalawang tanong si Nena.",
              "start_ms": 17640,
              "end_ms": 20320
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "Hindi pa alam: ang tiyak na lugar, ang lokal na itinalagang propesyonal na contact at ang paraang nais ni Nena sa pagtatanong.",
              "start_ms": 20620,
              "end_ms": 31020
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Hindi ipinapalagay ni Malou na kailangan ni Nena ng transportasyon o may partikular siyang sakit.",
              "start_ms": 31320,
              "end_ms": 38360
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "Nagtanong siya: \u201cAnong impormasyon ang makatutulong, at paano ninyo ito gustong matanggap?\u201d",
              "start_ms": 38660,
              "end_ms": 45140
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 7,
              "text": "Kathang-isip na detalye lamang ang gamitin sa pagsasanay.",
              "start_ms": 45440,
              "end_ms": 49320
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Ulitin, linawin at hayaang itama ng residente ang iyong pagkaunawa.",
              "start_ms": 49620,
              "end_ms": 55820
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "relationships-application-check": {
        "en": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/relationships-application-check.en.e4c0d280b174.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "e4c0d280b1743f49c5224a3762affee7d59b0d2eb6579ec03cdcb27269e644cc",
          "sha256": "2d473649b4f4117c20e57cf31cf910cced08ceae0f13d67b20f504a6061149eb",
          "duration_seconds": 60.212,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Explain and apply the relationships",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 2840
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Try the application check below.",
              "start_ms": 3140,
              "end_ms": 5620
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "In Nena's fictional situation, explain what each relationship can contribute and what it cannot decide.",
              "start_ms": 5920,
              "end_ms": 13760
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "Give a reason for the contact you choose and one question you would use to verify that person's role.",
              "start_ms": 14060,
              "end_ms": 21140
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "For equivalent written or paired practice, make four cards: resident's concern and choice; professional question; administrative support request; peer task.",
              "start_ms": 21440,
              "end_ms": 33920
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "Match each to an appropriate locally confirmed role, then explain the limits.",
              "start_ms": 34220,
              "end_ms": 40260
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Your partner can ask, \u201cWhat do you still need to clarify?\u201d",
              "start_ms": 40560,
              "end_ms": 44280
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "Use invented details, receive feedback and try again.",
              "start_ms": 44580,
              "end_ms": 49100
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 7,
              "text": "Judge the explanation, not the person's accent or personality.",
              "start_ms": 49400,
              "end_ms": 53880
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Explain the choice, verify the role and respect the resident\u2019s preferences.",
              "start_ms": 54180,
              "end_ms": 60140
            }
          ]
        },
        "fil": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/relationships-application-check.fil.48a85170d003.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "48a85170d003b7a7100cc26a8689ed11cf60d1c8d1de939314fe3d33fd7e2db6",
          "sha256": "a54c45052435385185dadd1d4672d634762277cdbdb30ac09539468667f70a17",
          "duration_seconds": 66.09,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Ipaliwanag at gamitin ang mga ugnayan",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 3760
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Subukan ang tanong sa ibaba.",
              "start_ms": 4060,
              "end_ms": 6220
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Sa kathang-isip na sitwasyon ni Nena, ipaliwanag ang maitutulong ng bawat ugnayan at ang hindi nito maaaring pagpasyahan.",
              "start_ms": 6520,
              "end_ms": 14800
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "Magbigay ng dahilan sa piniling contact at isang tanong upang tiyakin ang papel niya.",
              "start_ms": 15100,
              "end_ms": 20900
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "Para sa katumbas na pasulat o magkapares na pagsasanay, gumawa ng apat na card: alalahanin at pagpili ng residente; propesyonal na tanong; hiling na suportang administratibo; gawain ng kapwa BHW.",
              "start_ms": 21200,
              "end_ms": 38360
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "Itugma sa angkop na papel na tiniyak sa lokalidad, saka ipaliwanag ang hangganan.",
              "start_ms": 38660,
              "end_ms": 44260
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Maaaring itanong ng kapareha: \u201cAno pa ang kailangan mong linawin?\u201d",
              "start_ms": 44560,
              "end_ms": 49320
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "Gumamit ng kathang-isip na detalye, tumanggap ng puna at umulit.",
              "start_ms": 49620,
              "end_ms": 54900
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 7,
              "text": "Paliwanag ang suriin, hindi punto ng pagsasalita o personalidad.",
              "start_ms": 55200,
              "end_ms": 59800
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Ipaliwanag ang pagpili, tiyakin ang papel at igalang ang nais ng residente.",
              "start_ms": 60100,
              "end_ms": 66020
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "section-1": {
        "en": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-1.en.5570ac2a6af2.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "5570ac2a6af2264152202d3fc5d977a82e19ab3f981d2cb9f45d821d98eee7da",
          "sha256": "c4007ae906fbd2f52f7c2e09b885490263ea9cc9df8b6cf00b7adfc9a15d0bb9",
          "duration_seconds": 45.558,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Malou listens in the courtyard",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 2360
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "In this fictional learning situation, BHW Malou meets Aling Nena in a shaded barangay courtyard.",
              "start_ms": 2660,
              "end_ms": 9660
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Nena asks about a planned community health activity: \u201cWhere will it be held?",
              "start_ms": 9960,
              "end_ms": 15160
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "I also want to ask a health professional whether it is suitable for me.\u201d",
              "start_ms": 15460,
              "end_ms": 19780
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "Malou listens and asks which question Nena wants help with first.",
              "start_ms": 20080,
              "end_ms": 25000
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "The venue question and the personal health question need different kinds of support.",
              "start_ms": 25300,
              "end_ms": 30220
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Nena's preferences matter; Malou does not decide what she needs without asking.",
              "start_ms": 30520,
              "end_ms": 36000
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "Read or Slides can be completed without the optional story.",
              "start_ms": 36300,
              "end_ms": 40300
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Listen to the resident and separate the questions before choosing support.",
              "start_ms": 40600,
              "end_ms": 45480
            }
          ]
        },
        "fil": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-1.fil.87f852942a14.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "87f852942a14a7f06536424c07cb2269429937b44b7e30fd0c31d0cb805e0d44",
          "sha256": "6986f05b26d180931c1fe43be1a2343efa9de7f3807a709a2d6c3a2813d15214",
          "duration_seconds": 52.637,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Nakikinig si Malou sa bakuran",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 2600
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Sa kathang-isip na sitwasyong ito, nakatagpo ni BHW Malou si Aling Nena sa malilim na bakuran ng barangay.",
              "start_ms": 2900,
              "end_ms": 12020
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Nagtanong si Nena tungkol sa nakaplanong gawaing pangkalusugan: \u201cSaan po ito gaganapin?",
              "start_ms": 12320,
              "end_ms": 18840
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "Gusto ko ring itanong sa health professional kung angkop ito para sa akin.\u201d",
              "start_ms": 19140,
              "end_ms": 23300
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "Nakinig si Malou at nagtanong kung alin ang gustong unahing linawin ni Nena.",
              "start_ms": 23600,
              "end_ms": 28880
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "Magkaibang suporta ang kailangan sa tanong tungkol sa lugar at sa personal na kalusugan.",
              "start_ms": 29180,
              "end_ms": 35100
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Mahalaga ang pagpili ni Nena; hindi hinuhulaan ni Malou ang kaniyang pangangailangan.",
              "start_ms": 35400,
              "end_ms": 41400
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "Maaaring tapusin ang Read o Slides nang hindi pinapanood ang opsyonal na kuwento.",
              "start_ms": 41700,
              "end_ms": 47220
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Makinig sa residente at ihiwalay ang mga tanong bago pumili ng suporta.",
              "start_ms": 47520,
              "end_ms": 52560
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "section-2": {
        "en": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-2.en.56ee444fbab3.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "56ee444fbab33dfd5b5c2f38c3761cc43c7857ba262cea9d5bb0892f40f39b9b",
          "sha256": "10060417c252aa0be30144cf868cf10f025df570aad5253e28f88e1e35ce2a33",
          "duration_seconds": 76.669,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Four relationships, different purposes",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 3320
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "This lesson uses four relationships as an authored teaching organizer, not an official four-category chain of command.",
              "start_ms": 3620,
              "end_ms": 11700
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Community: residents and families contribute their concerns, information and choices.",
              "start_ms": 12000,
              "end_ms": 18720
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "Listen and clarify with them rather than treating them as passive recipients.",
              "start_ms": 19020,
              "end_ms": 24380
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "Designated midwife or Rural Health Unit health professional: seek authorized professional guidance for health questions, following locally confirmed arrangements.",
              "start_ms": 24680,
              "end_ms": 36240
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "A BHW or peer does not replace professional assessment.",
              "start_ms": 36540,
              "end_ms": 41340
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Barangay officials: ask the responsible local contact about administrative support, facilities or activity arrangements.",
              "start_ms": 41640,
              "end_ms": 51400
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "Support depends on local roles and available resources; it is not guaranteed.",
              "start_ms": 51700,
              "end_ms": 57700
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 7,
              "text": "Fellow BHWs: share routine work experience, coordinate agreed tasks and help identify questions to clarify.",
              "start_ms": 58000,
              "end_ms": 66720
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 8,
              "text": "Peer advice does not become clinical authority.",
              "start_ms": 67020,
              "end_ms": 70700
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Each relationship has a purpose and a limit; verify the local roles.",
              "start_ms": 71000,
              "end_ms": 76600
            }
          ]
        },
        "fil": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-2.fil.1e2a31cc2ce6.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "1e2a31cc2ce6e24331ada007ca3d380dcb3ad2a1d223389b8d629cda68bc4f30",
          "sha256": "c49fbc25deebe148081cc65396e1adbb1f0300e9d044d8e00e632d83a3a2d6e4",
          "duration_seconds": 86.596,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Apat na ugnayan, magkakaibang layunin",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 3440
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Ginagamit sa araling ito ang apat na ugnayan bilang ginawang balangkas sa pagtuturo, hindi opisyal na apat na antas ng pamamahala.",
              "start_ms": 3740,
              "end_ms": 13380
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Komunidad: ibinabahagi ng mga residente at pamilya ang kanilang alalahanin, impormasyon at pagpili.",
              "start_ms": 13680,
              "end_ms": 21960
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "Makinig at maglinaw kasama nila; hindi lamang sila tagatanggap ng tulong.",
              "start_ms": 22260,
              "end_ms": 27740
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "Itinalagang midwife o health professional ng Rural Health Unit: humingi ng awtorisadong propesyonal na gabay sa tanong pangkalusugan, ayon sa lokal na kaayusang tiniyak.",
              "start_ms": 28040,
              "end_ms": 40560
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "Hindi kapalit ng propesyonal na pagtatasa ang BHW o kapwa BHW.",
              "start_ms": 40860,
              "end_ms": 47100
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Barangay officials: itanong sa responsableng lokal na contact ang suportang administratibo, pasilidad o kaayusan ng aktibidad.",
              "start_ms": 47400,
              "end_ms": 57160
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "Nakasalalay ang suporta sa lokal na papel at magagamit na kagamitan; walang garantiya.",
              "start_ms": 57460,
              "end_ms": 64140
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 7,
              "text": "Kapwa BHW: magbahagi ng karanasan sa karaniwang gawain, mag-ugnay ng napagkasunduang mga tungkulin at tumulong tukuyin ang dapat linawin.",
              "start_ms": 64440,
              "end_ms": 75720
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 8,
              "text": "Hindi nagiging klinikal na awtoridad ang payo ng kapwa BHW.",
              "start_ms": 76020,
              "end_ms": 81100
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "May layunin at hangganan ang bawat ugnayan; tiyakin ang lokal na papel.",
              "start_ms": 81400,
              "end_ms": 86520
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "section-3": {
        "en": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-3.en.8f3a2920f542.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "8f3a2920f54239314a5bce8c824b648f065d3f7420d177a7c35d740aeacbc041",
          "sha256": "e985831e79cb6b99a651a15f2445792f04a880490a0343af75f367b435ce66eb",
          "duration_seconds": 56.607,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Choose a contact for the concern",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 2400
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "For Nena's personal health question, Malou helps clarify the locally designated midwife or authorized health professional and how to contact them.",
              "start_ms": 2700,
              "end_ms": 12620
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "She explains: \u201cThis question needs professional guidance; I should not answer it through a guess.\u201d",
              "start_ms": 12920,
              "end_ms": 19120
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "The exact local arrangement must be confirmed.",
              "start_ms": 19420,
              "end_ms": 22660
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "For the venue, Malou checks the activity's verified information and asks the responsible local coordinator if anything remains unclear.",
              "start_ms": 22960,
              "end_ms": 31920
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "Ask a contact, \u201cIs this within your role?",
              "start_ms": 32220,
              "end_ms": 35580
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "If not, who is responsible?\u201d",
              "start_ms": 35880,
              "end_ms": 38520
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "Position or familiarity alone does not establish the right role.",
              "start_ms": 38820,
              "end_ms": 44180
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 7,
              "text": "This is an organizational example, not medical triage or a universal referral sequence.",
              "start_ms": 44480,
              "end_ms": 51080
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Choose by the concern and confirmed role, rather than rank alone.",
              "start_ms": 51380,
              "end_ms": 56540
            }
          ]
        },
        "fil": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/section-3.fil.3078161687b0.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "3078161687b044af4c0ea068a1c7ffbfdfe8474b651b0924dcde2d9c2ea9f225",
          "sha256": "80045305b471c0c209230b1838ee7cf5bba20a59d6d21505eec655074392afcc",
          "duration_seconds": 62.616,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Piliin ang contact ayon sa alalahanin",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 3120
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Para sa personal na tanong pangkalusugan ni Nena, tumutulong si Malou na linawin ang lokal na itinalagang midwife o awtorisadong health professional at ang paraan ng pakikipag-ugnayan.",
              "start_ms": 3420,
              "end_ms": 15940
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Ipinaliwanag niya: \u201cKailangan dito ng propesyonal na gabay; hindi ako dapat sumagot sa pamamagitan ng hula.\u201d",
              "start_ms": 16240,
              "end_ms": 23680
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "Dapat tiyakin ang mismong lokal na kaayusan.",
              "start_ms": 23980,
              "end_ms": 26940
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "Para sa lugar, sinusuri ni Malou ang natiyak na impormasyon ng aktibidad at nagtatanong sa responsableng lokal na coordinator kung may malabo pa.",
              "start_ms": 27240,
              "end_ms": 37120
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "Itanong sa contact: \u201cSaklaw po ba ito ng inyong papel?",
              "start_ms": 37420,
              "end_ms": 41740
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Kung hindi, sino po ang responsable?\u201d",
              "start_ms": 42040,
              "end_ms": 44840
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "Hindi sapat ang posisyon o pagiging kakilala.",
              "start_ms": 45140,
              "end_ms": 48420
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 7,
              "text": "Halimbawang pang-organisasyon ito, hindi medikal na triage o iisang proseso ng referral para sa lahat.",
              "start_ms": 48720,
              "end_ms": 56360
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Pumili ayon sa alalahanin at natiyak na papel, hindi sa posisyon lamang.",
              "start_ms": 56660,
              "end_ms": 62540
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "shared-support": {
        "en": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/shared-support.en.8b6326bb9fa2.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "8b6326bb9fa2a9b24d9667ad020871edaff4f7f8ab6df8da349a7e1c2ad90c7a",
          "sha256": "076e2c31eb05af626dc6827afc7e40bb6ac358269edbb75a3d5208200c986256",
          "duration_seconds": 58.201,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Coordinate support without replacing roles",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 3400
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Malou keeps the questions separate while coordinating support.",
              "start_ms": 3700,
              "end_ms": 7780
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "With Nena's agreement, she helps identify a suitable channel for the professional question.",
              "start_ms": 8080,
              "end_ms": 13800
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "Separately, the responsible barangay contact may clarify the venue or a request for practical support.",
              "start_ms": 14100,
              "end_ms": 20860
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "A fellow BHW can help Malou organize an agreed routine task and check what remains unclear.",
              "start_ms": 21160,
              "end_ms": 28520
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "Nena contributes her preferences throughout.",
              "start_ms": 28820,
              "end_ms": 32300
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Malou confirms what was actually agreed and what is still unknown.",
              "start_ms": 32600,
              "end_ms": 38040
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "An official or peer cannot replace the health professional's assessment.",
              "start_ms": 38340,
              "end_ms": 43820
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 7,
              "text": "No relationship guarantees transport, supplies, a response time or a successful outcome.",
              "start_ms": 44120,
              "end_ms": 52240
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Coordinate distinct roles without promising resources or replacing assessment.",
              "start_ms": 52540,
              "end_ms": 58140
            }
          ]
        },
        "fil": {
          "src": "/training/audio/05-bhw-at-barangay/bhw-relationships/shared-support.fil.284ae77c1442.mp3",
          "voice": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash-tts:Kore",
          "content_hash": "284ae77c14429e93d0c82a158018930b6664aa0614ca9e0f17e00900e2e4b43f",
          "sha256": "6d1ecb602731ab410550f9fa304373a59f00dfb00c05713492f29c00e57e4ae8",
          "duration_seconds": 60.291,
          "timings": [
            {
              "zone": "heading",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Mag-ugnay ng suporta nang may malinaw na papel",
              "start_ms": 0,
              "end_ms": 3800
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Pinaghihiwalay ni Malou ang mga tanong habang pinag-uugnay ang suporta.",
              "start_ms": 4100,
              "end_ms": 8620
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 1,
              "text": "Sa pagsang-ayon ni Nena, tumutulong siyang tukuyin ang angkop na paraan para sa propesyonal na tanong.",
              "start_ms": 8920,
              "end_ms": 15800
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 2,
              "text": "Hiwalay dito, maaaring linawin ng responsableng barangay contact ang lugar o hiling na praktikal na suporta.",
              "start_ms": 16100,
              "end_ms": 23860
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 3,
              "text": "Maaaring tulungan ng kapwa BHW si Malou na ayusin ang napagkasunduang karaniwang gawain at alamin ang malabo pa.",
              "start_ms": 24160,
              "end_ms": 32320
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 4,
              "text": "Patuloy na ibinabahagi ni Nena ang kaniyang pagpili.",
              "start_ms": 32620,
              "end_ms": 35860
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 5,
              "text": "Tinitiyak ni Malou ang talagang napagkasunduan at ang hindi pa alam.",
              "start_ms": 36160,
              "end_ms": 41080
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 6,
              "text": "Hindi kapalit ng health professional ang opisyal o kapwa BHW.",
              "start_ms": 41380,
              "end_ms": 47020
            },
            {
              "zone": "body",
              "index": 7,
              "text": "Walang garantiya ng transportasyon, kagamitan, oras ng sagot o matagumpay na resulta.",
              "start_ms": 47320,
              "end_ms": 54120
            },
            {
              "zone": "takeaway",
              "index": 0,
              "text": "Pag-ugnayin ang magkakaibang papel nang walang pangako o kapalit na pagtatasa.",
              "start_ms": 54420,
              "end_ms": 60220
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
